WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Type II is the bread and butter of residential HVAC. This is what you'll use
every day.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Recovery equipment lab: connect recovery machine to a system, recover
refrigerant to required levels, weigh the recovered amount, properly handle the
recovery cylinder. Practice connecting manifold gauges, operating the recovery

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: You will use recovery equipment on every
major repair. Speed and proper technique matter.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Never overfill recovery cylinders past 80 percent. And —
Verify recovery is complete before opening the system

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
What recovery level do you need on a system under 200 pounds using post-1993
equipment? Know that cold.

